  - `public VectorialPointValuePair optimize(DifferentiableMultivariateVectorialFunction f, double[] target, double[] weights, double[] startPoint) throws FunctionEvaluationException, OptimizationException, IllegalArgumentException` (shared field(s): residuals, residualsWeights, rows)
      doc: {@inheritDoc}
  - `protected void updateJacobian() throws FunctionEvaluationException` (shared field(s): residualsWeights, rows)
      doc: Update the jacobian matrix. @exception FunctionEvaluationException if the function jacobian cannot be evaluated or its dimension doesn't match problem dimension
  - `public double[][] getCovariances() throws FunctionEvaluationException, OptimizationException` (shared field(s): rows)
